# Shared static API key for the external customer-facing tracking app (live order tracking).
# Generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# IMPORTANT: the exact same value must be manually placed in the customer app's own .env
# (separate codebase, not managed here) — this is a manual handoff step.
TRACKING_API_KEY=

# Brevo transactional email (delivery OTP) — to be supplied later, do not fabricate
